  "name_words": {
    "_note": "Other words with several spellings. Street-type words and directionals are canonicalised wherever they appear, so 'Valley Drive Extension' and 'Valley Dr Ext' give the same key. 'st' before a name word means Saint; that rule is in code because it depends on position.",
